      "cooked": "<p>A quick search of the forum by eye (not the Search function) didn't show anything about the DM's Guild.</p><p>Basically, WotC are letting people publish content for 5th Edition D&amp;D through a website they monitor along with the company behind all the DriveThru sites.</p><p>So I did. <a href=\"http://www.dmsguild.com/product/173170/Spirit-Master\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.dmsguild.com/product/173170/Spirit-Master</a></p><p>For the interested, my design notes can found here: <a href=\"http://wp.me/p2XTTv-3F\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">http://wp.me/p2XTTv-3F</a><br>&nbsp;</p>",
